            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The dataset consists of 13637 observations from 12 countries: UK, Germany, Netherlands, Austria, France, Spain, Italy, Hungary, Poland, Denmark, Finland, Sweden. \n\nThe file Data_NGOcrowding_archive.dta includes raw data as well as reworked data, Datapackage NGOcrowding_info.pdf includes a stem file with the commands used in stata for estimating the model. Additional documentation and metadata can be found in the file Data Report_NGOcrowding_JEPM_20211215.pdf"
